   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Moshi",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It can feel strange. Do you get on with them?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Yeah, mostly. One of them also applied, though.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg10",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then be professional and treat it like a real interview, even though they know you. Don't skip details because you assume they already know.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 1.03,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I mention specific things",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.08,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "we did together, or is that weird?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 2.41,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg10",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Mention them. Concrete examples they witnessed are actually powerful, because they can confirm them.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.19,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg10"
  },
  {
